--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,440] | Elapsed:  14.76s | Words: 6  | Text: 你们为什么不相信爱情
Segment #2   [00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:02,840] | Elapsed:  14.76s | Words: 8  | Text: 你们曾经没有过爱情吗
Segment #3   [00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:04,360] | Elapsed:  14.76s | Words: 6  | Text: 为什么你们在上学的时候
Segment #4   [00:00:04,360 --> 00:00:06,620] | Elapsed:  14.76s | Words: 10 | Text: 在学校里的时候认识一个女孩子
Segment #5   [00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:09,460] | Elapsed:  14.76s | Words: 13 | Text: 你可以把自己毫无保留的东西给一个人
Segment #6   [00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:10,760] | Elapsed:  14.76s | Words: 7  | Text: 那个时候你相信爱情吗
Segment #7   [00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:11,120] | Elapsed:  14.76s | Words: 2  | Text: 你相信
Segment #8   [00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:13,020] | Elapsed:  14.76s | Words: 10 | Text: 那为什么当你们踏入社会以后
Segment #9   [00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:14,160] | Elapsed:  14.76s | Words: 6  | Text: 你们不相信爱情了
Segment #10  [00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:15,460] | Elapsed:  14.76s | Words: 8  | Text: 你们没有看过成功学吗
Segment #11  [00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:16,460] | Elapsed:  14.76s | Words: 5  | Text: 相信相信的力量
Segment #12  [00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:18,340] | Elapsed:  14.76s | Words: 9  | Text: 当你相信这个女人爱你的时候
Segment #13  [00:00:18,340 --> 00:00:19,560] | Elapsed:  14.76s | Words: 6  | Text: 你就会得到爱情
Segment #14  [00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:22,860] | Elapsed:  14.76s | Words: 16 | Text: 当你觉得天底下所有的女人都不值得被爱
Segment #15  [00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:24,900] | Elapsed:  14.76s | Words: 9  | Text: 你也不会相信任何爱情的时候
Segment #16  [00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:26,160] | Elapsed:  14.76s | Words: 8  | Text: 这一刻作为一个男人
Segment #17  [00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:27,300] | Elapsed:  14.76s | Words: 9  | Text: 或者说作为一个女人来说
Segment #18  [00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:28,720] | Elapsed:  14.76s | Words: 7  | Text: 当一个人眼里没有光
Segment #19  [00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:30,600] | Elapsed:  33.00s | Words: 9  | Text: 当一个人骨子里没有爱的时候
Segment #20  [00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:31,560] | Elapsed:  33.00s | Words: 4  | Text: 你就已经没了
Segment #21  [00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:33,080] | Elapsed:  33.00s | Words: 6  | Text: 有很多的人现在活着
Segment #22  [00:00:33,080 --> 00:00:34,480] | Elapsed:  33.00s | Words: 9  | Text: 其实在我心里他已经没了
Segment #23  [00:00:34,480 --> 00:00:36,100] | Elapsed:  33.00s | Words: 5  | Text: 有很多人没了
Segment #24  [00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:37,400] | Elapsed:  33.00s | Words: 9  | Text: 在我心里头永远活着
Segment #25  [00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:38,640] | Elapsed:  33.00s | Words: 6  | Text: 大家感觉爱是什么
Segment #26  [00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:39,640] | Elapsed:  33.00s | Words: 5  | Text: 在你们的眼里
Segment #27  [00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:41,460] | Elapsed:  33.00s | Words: 11 | Text: 我刚才问你们有多少人相信爱情
Segment #28  [00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:42,980] | Elapsed:  33.00s | Words: 9  | Text: 你们没有任何一个人相信爱情
Segment #29  [00:00:42,980 --> 00:00:44,640] | Elapsed:  33.00s | Words: 6  | Text: 在你们的脑海里
Segment #30  [00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:46,160] | Elapsed:  33.00s | Words: 8  | Text: 爱是摧毁 爱是霸占
Segment #31  [00:00:46,160 --> 00:00:47,860] | Elapsed:  33.00s | Words: 8  | Text: 爱是让一个人过得不好
Segment #32  [00:00:47,860 --> 00:00:48,580] | Elapsed:  33.00s | Words: 4  | Text: 但我告诉你
Segment #33  [00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:49,980] | Elapsed:  33.00s | Words: 9  | Text: 换一种角度在我的角度
Segment #34  [00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:51,320] | Elapsed:  33.00s | Words: 6  | Text: 你们知道我的爱是什么
Segment #35  [00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:52,940] | Elapsed:  33.00s | Words: 9  | Text: 爱一个人是希望他过得好
Segment #36  [00:00:52,940 --> 00:00:54,960] | Elapsed:  33.00s | Words: 12 | Text: 爱一个人是哪怕这个人伤害了我
Segment #37  [00:00:54,960 --> 00:00:56,860] | Elapsed:  33.00s | Words: 10 | Text: 哪怕这个人跟别的男人走了
Segment #38  [00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:57,680] | Elapsed:  33.00s | Words: 5  | Text: 站在我的角度
Segment #39  [00:00:57,680 --> 00:00:58,480] | Elapsed:  40.83s | Words: 3  | Text: 我爱他
Segment #40  [00:00:58,480 --> 00:00:59,700] | Elapsed:  40.83s | Words: 4  | Text: 因为我爱他
Segment #41  [00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:01,160] | Elapsed:  40.83s | Words: 7  | Text: 他现在只要过得好
Segment #42  [00:01:01,160 --> 00:01:02,720] | Elapsed:  40.83s | Words: 5  | Text: 我会看到他的好
Segment #43  [00:01:02,720 --> 00:01:04,340] | Elapsed:  40.83s | Words: 8  | Text: 感受到我自己的温暖
Segment #44  [00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:05,020] | Elapsed:  40.83s | Words: 2  | Text: 这是爱
